  "content": "\n\n<p>此模組將原版的紅石礦替換為完全相同的紅石礦，當與其互動時不會開始發光或產生粒子效果。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>此模組是應 Darkosto 的請求而製作的。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如有任何問題，歡迎加入我的 Discord。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/maPeNBK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/611982123435556884/widget.png?style=banner2\" alt=\"Discord 連結\" width=\"320\" height=\"76\"></a></p>\n<h2>&nbsp;<strong>想支持我們嗎？</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Mrbysco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CEpJohV.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"152\" height=\"35\"></a>&nbsp; -Mrbysco</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/shynieke\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CEpJohV.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"152\" height=\"35\"></a>&nbsp; -ShyNieke</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fstekkie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">需要伺服器嗎？</a></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fstekkie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Etl1Cya.png\"> </a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #e3e3e3;line-height:0;display:none\">&nbsp;</div>",
